[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557417029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112981#issuecomment-3557417029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981","id":3557417029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UCeBF","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T11:13:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T11:13:09Z","body":"This is not trivial to change, it stores just a name, not a proper reference, so it would only work with renaming instances that are currently open. Adding a check when renaming to update all open scenes wouldn't be too hard, but other scenes wouldn't be easy to rename and it could be a slow process in large projects\n\nWe could have a rename list internally but that could be error prone\n\nIn the end the balance can be tricky when assuming what the user wants. This is a trivial case but what if you split a bus in two, or swap the names of two buses but want the audio players to stay on the original names?\n\nBut something to discuss","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557417029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557971053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112981#issuecomment-3557971053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981","id":3557971053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UElRt","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T13:07:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T13:07:19Z","body":"I would propose that the first step is to display an error message.\n\n`scene/audio/audio_stream_player_internal.cpp:344`\n\n```C++\nStringName AudioStreamPlayerInternal::get_bus() const {\n\tconst String bus_name = bus;\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < AudioServer::get_singleton()->get_bus_count(); i++) {\n\t\tif (AudioServer::get_singleton()->get_bus_name(i) == bus_name) {\n\t\t\treturn bus;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n✅\tERR_PRINT_ONCE_ED(vformat(\"Audio bus '%s' cannot be found. Switching to '%s'.\", bus_name, SceneStringName(Master)));\n\n\treturn SceneStringName(Master);\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3557971053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3558061454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112981#issuecomment-3558061454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981","id":3558061454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UE7WO","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T13:27:15Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T13:27:15Z","body":"That might be more noisy than needed, and would be unhelpful in some cases\n\nAlso the suggested code would be incorrect as it'd only warn once per time the editor runs, regardless of the bus name, so you'd miss it if you open a new scene or make a different rename","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3558061454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559091097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112981#issuecomment-3559091097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981","id":3559091097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UI2uZ","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T16:57:15Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T16:57:15Z","body":"> In the end the balance can be tricky when assuming what the user wants\n\nOne would assume, when renaming a bus, the setting on an AudioStreamPlayer will stay the same and not **silently** change to another value because logically you haven't changed the bus, you just changed its name. After using any DAW for a reasonable amount of time this behaviour is very confusing. Otherwise it's not obvious that after the name change any AudioStreamPlayer with that bus will be played on the Master bus instead until you see/hear that the wrong bus is used.\n\n> what if you split a bus in two, or swap the names of two buses but want the audio players to stay on the original names?\n\nI am not sure there is a problem when splitting a bus in two because (I hope) you cannot have two buses with identical names. With the latter I'm not sure I understand what that means.\n\nI wanna say that it would be less confusing if the bus setting on the AudioStreamPlayer was an input and not a dropdown.\n\nBut then again it's confusing why AudioStreamPlayer uses a bus name as a reference instead of a bus index like AudioServer does from code. It seems like it should use a combination of bus name + index to work properly so it won't lose the bus reference if you rename the bus and won't lose the reference if you reorder them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559091097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559631126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112981#issuecomment-3559631126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112981","id":3559631126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UK6kW","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T19:11:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T19:11:22Z","body":"The old value is erased because it is invalid, but buses are accessed by name because their indices aren't guaranteed, you can also rearrange them so neither access type is guaranteed to remain\n\nBut we can add a warning when the name is invalid, possibly allowing you to fix it with a dialog, but having it be left invalid would be weird IMO, but it's not simple and you'd get errors and unexpected behavior either way","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559631126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]